#. de: Geübte Hand
#. fr: Main experte
#. column 1: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Specialist Action</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Significantly increases both progress and quality.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Efficiency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 150%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Success Rate:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 100%<br><br>Available only when <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Inner Quiet</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Whistle</ui-edge-color></ui-color> stack sizes are identical.
msgctxt "CraftAction:100161:0:0"
msgid "Trained Hand"
msgstr "Рука мастера"

