msgid "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Specialist Action</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Uses one <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Whistle</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to restore 15 CP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Success Rate:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 100%<br><br>Available only when the <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Whistle</ui-edge-color></ui-color> stack size is a multiple of three."
