#. column 1: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Specialist Action</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Increases <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Inner Quiet</ui-edge-color></ui-color> stack by three (up to 11). Can only be used when <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Initial Preparations</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active.
msgctxt "CraftAction:100275:0:0"
msgid "Specialty: Reflect"
msgstr "Особый приём: Отражение"

