msgid "Increases <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>quality</ui-edge-color></ui-color> at greater cost to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>durability</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Inner Quiet</ui-edge-color></ui-color> stack by one (up to 10)<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Efficiency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 200%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Success Rate:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 100%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Durability Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>20"
