#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 10)><if ($gn69 >= 96)><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>E… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
